abstract: >-
  CausalAgentBench is a research benchmark for tool-using language agents under
  controlled interventions. It pairs clean task instances with targeted
  perturbations to measure whether specific agent skills survive environmental
  stress. This repository is an initial research scaffold; empirical claims
  require verified non-stub runs documented in docs/claim_ledger.json.
